@startuml StateMachine_Booking_Lifecycle

title State Machine Diagram - Booking Lifecycle\n(Actual Implementation - Verified Against Code)

[*] --> pending : Create Booking\nBookingService.confirmBooking()

state "pending" as pending #LightYellow {
    pending : Booking created
    pending : Waiting for payment confirmation
    pending : Associated with Transaction
}

state "confirmed" as confirmed #LightGreen {
    confirmed : Payment successful (webhook received)
    confirmed : Vehicle reserved for user
    confirmed : Booking is active and finalized
}

state "canceled" as canceled #LightPink {
    canceled : User or admin canceled
    canceled : Or payment intent canceled by Stripe
    canceled : Vehicle becomes available
}

pending --> confirmed : Stripe Webhook\n[payment_intent.succeeded]\nWebhookService updates booking
note on link
    **Trigger:** Stripe webhook event
    **Webhook Handler:** 
    handleStripeWebhookEvent()
    
    **Actions:**
    1. Find transaction by providerPaymentId
    2. Update transaction.status = "Completed"
    3. Update booking.status = "confirmed"
    
    **Code Location:**
    webhookService.js line 34-38
end note

pending --> canceled : User Cancels\nPUT /api/v1/user/booking/cancel/:id
note on link
    **Trigger:** User action
    **Method:** BookingService.cancelBooking()
    
    **Action:**
    findOneAndUpdate(
      {_id: bookingId},
      {status: "canceled"}
    )
    
    **Code Location:**
    bookingService.js line 72-78
end note

pending --> canceled : Stripe Webhook\n[payment_intent.canceled]
note on link
    **Trigger:** Stripe webhook event
    
    **Actions:**
    1. Update transaction.status = "Cancelled"
    2. Update booking.status = "canceled"
    
    **Reasons:**
    • User abandoned payment
    • Admin canceled via Stripe
    
    **Code Location:**
    webhookService.js line 72-79
end note

confirmed --> canceled : User/Admin Cancels\ncancelBooking(bookingId)
note on link
    **Trigger:** User or admin action
    **Allowed:** Before rental start date
    
    **Side Effects:**
    • May trigger refund (future)
    • Vehicle availability updated
end note

canceled --> [*] : Archived

confirmed --> [*] : Rental Completed

note right of pending
    **Entry Conditions:**
    • BookingRequest confirmed
    • Transaction created
    • Payment intent generated
    
    **Waiting For:**
    • User to complete payment
    • Webhook: payment_intent.succeeded
    
    **Important:**
    If payment_intent.payment_failed,
    booking stays "pending"
    (NOT canceled automatically)
end note

note right of confirmed
    **Entry Actions:**
    • Transaction marked "Completed"
    • Notifications sent (future)
    
    **Invariants:**
    • Transaction.status = "Completed"
    • Payment captured in Stripe
    
    **Immutable:**
    Cannot go back to pending
end note

note right of canceled
    **Entry Actions:**
    • Release vehicle
    • Update availability
    
    **Cleanup:**
    • BookingRequest marked canceled
    • May process refund
end note

note bottom of pending
    **Key Insight:**
    payment_intent.payment_failed does NOT
    automatically cancel booking.
    
    Booking remains "pending" so user can
    retry payment with new payment intent.
end note

@enduml
